    "sub_name": "保險市場發展專題",
    "sub_ename": "SPECIAL TOPICS ON INSURANCE MARKET DEVELOPMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程講述以台灣保險市場之發展與現況為基礎，並延伸至全球各大洲主要保險市場之發展與現況，全球保險市場將針對北美洲、拉丁美洲、亞洲、歐洲、大洋洲及非洲分別介紹。",
    "describe_eh": "This course provides an overview of the development and current status of the insurance market in Taiwan as a basis, and it will extend to the development and current status of major insurance markets in North America, Latin America, Asia, Europe, Oceania and Africa., respectively.",
